1.Number Input F.e(52719)
2.Analysis of each digit:
 Analysis of each digit takes 0.5 seconds
 2.1If number is even then Led blinks for 200ms(200ms on,200ms off)
 2.2If number is odd Led just ~ its current state(if on ,then it turns off.If off,then it turns on)
3.Interrupt from Button press!
 3.1Led Freezes(State remains unchanged)
 3.2Prints "Button pressed.Led locked.Count=x" and Count = the number of button presses since the start
 3.3The numeric analysis continues in Uart but without any Led acivities
 3.4UartvsButton-->Button press has higher priority
4.Exit from the Freeze state--> second press of the button
5.New number Input!
 5.1When the Analysis is complete we ask for another number
 5.2The user can ANY time of the analysis to JUST input a new number
  5.2.1The running analysis STOPS immediately
  5.2.2Starts a new numeric analysis from the start
                                                  
